<%# Keeps password recovery focused on the action, time limit, and what happens if ignored. %>
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:28px; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.5px;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;">Someone requested a password reset for your Careergrind account. Choose a new password to regain access.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;"><%= link_to "Reset password", @reset_password_url, style: "display:inline-block; padding:13px 24px; border-radius:8px; background-color:#285c45; color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;" %></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#626b63; font-size:14px;">This link expires after six hours. Requesting another email replaces it.</p>
<p style="margin:0; color:#626b63; font-size:14px;">Your password stays unchanged until you choose a new one. If you did not request this, ignore this email.</p>
